# Beads/Dolt tool-managed data — config.yaml, metadata.json, issues.jsonl,
# PRIME.md, formulas, identity are written/rewritten by the beads CLI, not
# Prettier. Checking them makes `format:check` (and CI) fail whenever the
# tooling rewrites them unformatted.
.beads/
# Polecat per-bead git worktrees (git-excluded via .git/info/exclude, 0 tracked
# files, absent on clean CI checkouts). Without this, `prettier --check .`
# recursively scans every nested worktree — each a full repo copy — producing
# false `format:check`/`ci:local` failures and near-hangs in agent home worktrees.
worktrees/
